COMPILATION OF: E49C3

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E49C3

   1 a 0000 E49C3:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-49/P3] E49C1's shape under ^= : the CA skip byte in the
   4 a 0006      equal-length member-left literal template ([C072]/[C333]
   5 a 0006      measured CA in this family member-vs-literal 3/2 and member-
   6 a 0006      vs-member 3/3; the equal literal case has no object).  Length
   7 a 0006      collapse or not is the same A-panel discriminator as E49C1. */
   8 c 0006   dcl
   9 c 0006     1 rec,
  10 c 0006       2 na char(3),
  11 c 0006       2 nb char(3),
  12 c 0006       2 s2 char(2);
  13 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  14 c 0006   if rec.na ^= 'ABC' then k = 1;
  15 c 001C   put list('K=', k);
  16 c 003E   stop;
  17 a 0041 end E49C3;

CODE SIZE = 0041
DATA AREA = 000F
FREE SYMS = 386E
END  COMPILATION
